## BenchmarkDotNet
## The logs, .csv and .html are noise — but the github-markdown reports are the
## provenance for every number quoted in the docs, so they ship.
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/
!samples/PerfLab/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/
samples/PerfLab/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/*.log
!samples/PerfLab/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/results/
samples/PerfLab/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/results/*
!samples/PerfLab/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/results/*-report-github.md

## Diagnostics captures — these are large and often contain production data.
## Never commit them; a .gcdump has no field values but a full dump does.
*.nettrace
*.speedscope.json
*.gcdump
*.etl
*.etlx
core_*
dump_*
*.dmp

